---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = '2026-05-23';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Rules for using Reta.">
  <article class="prose-reta px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-900/60">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>Eligibility</h2>
    <p>Reta is intended for users 18 years of age or older. By using the site, you confirm that you meet this requirement.</p>

    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>Articles on Reta are for general information and entertainment. We are not therapists, lawyers, or matchmakers. Use your own judgment, and consult a professional for serious decisions.</p>

    <h2>Sponsored links</h2>
    <p>Some links on Reta are sponsored. We may earn a commission when you sign up for a service we recommend. We only recommend services we believe are reasonable for the audience described, but we cannot guarantee outcomes, matches, or service quality. Read our <a href="/disclaimer/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>No guarantees</h2>
    <p>We make no promise of finding a match, a date, or a relationship. Dating involves real people and real risks. Always verify identities, meet in public, and tell a friend.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Do not scrape Reta at scale, attempt to compromise the site, or use the content to harass others. We may block access at our discretion.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of Reta means you accept the updated version.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
